  "details": "Hello, I like a lot the recent SteamVR bindings open beta.\n\nThere are 2 actions that I'd like to bind, that are currently missing:\n\n1) Lock Portable mirror\n\n2) Stream camera\n\n3) In 1 handed mode: it is not currently possible to bind portable_mirror yet. \n\nSome bindings are missing in 1 handed mode.\n\nThose additional bindings would be useful in my opinion.\n\nHave a good day.",
